fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkan/vulkanh264enc.html#vulkanh264enc:quality","fragment":"\n\tquality\n\nVideo encode quality level.\nHigher quality levels may produce higher quality videos at the cost of\nadditional processing time.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t2\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});